      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The Aga Khan University had organized an Inter Medical College Cricket Tournament for which the final was played on June 1; 2000.This was the first such Tournament amongst medical institutions. Teams from six medical colleges had participated. These included Baqai Medical College, Dow Medical College, Hamdard Medical College, Jinnah Medical College, Ziauddin Medical College and The Aga Khan University (AKU) Medical College."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Following are the results for the Final played between Baqai Medical College and Dow Medical College, at the AKU Sports and Rehabilitation Center Cricket Ground. "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Toss won by Baqai Medical College, who elected to bat first. "
